# Low Tier (Starter) — Google Sheets Workbook Template

**Who this is for:** Starter 100 / Starter 200 / Starter 300 clients  
**Total tabs:** 12  
**Protection:** Tabs marked 🔒 should be protected. Clients may view but not edit.

---

## HOW TO SET UP

1. Make a copy of the Low Tier Master Template spreadsheet.
2. Rename it: `[Business Name] — Voice Agent`
3. Share with the Google Service Account email (from your `.env`): **Editor** access.
4. Paste the Sheet ID into the Master Backend Sheet → Client Roster → Column G.
5. Fill in the Business Info tab.
6. Set up protection on all 🔒 tabs (see Protection Instructions at bottom).

