## TAB 3: Needs Attention Today

Auto-filtered view of Call Log showing open callbacks and urgent calls.  
Formula-driven — do not add rows manually.

| Col | Field |
|-----|-------|
| A | call_date |
| B | caller_name |
| C | caller_phone |
| D | service_requested |
| E | urgency |
| F | callback_needed |
| G | next_action |
| H | resolved (team fills: TRUE when done) |

**Setup:** Add a filter or use `=FILTER(...)` pulling from Call Log where callback_needed=TRUE OR urgency=Urgent.

