## TAB 5: FAQ List

Client-editable. Define approved answers the AI may give.

| Col | Field |
|-----|-------|
| A | question |
| B | approved_answer |
| C | service_category (optional) |
| D | active (TRUE/FALSE) |

**Important:** The AI will ONLY answer questions in this list. Anything not listed gets "the team will follow up."

**Minimum recommended FAQs to fill in:**
- What are your hours?
- Where are you located?
- Do you offer free estimates?
- How do I schedule an appointment?
- What areas do you serve?

