## PROTECTION INSTRUCTIONS

1. Open your Google Sheet.
2. Right-click the tab name → **Protect sheet**.
3. Click **Set permissions** → **Restrict who can edit this range**.
4. Select **Only you** (or add the service account as an editor, remove all others).
5. Repeat for all 🔒 tabs: Call Log, Needs Attention Today, Appointments (partially), Do Not Call, SMS Log, Missed Call Recovery, Monthly Usage, Error Log.

**Client-editable tabs:** Business Info, FAQ List, Calendly Links

